{
  "tema": 9653,
  "slug": "ya-veremos",
  "titulo": "Ya + future = at some point (ya veremos, ya me contarás)",
  "subtitulo": "Ya veremos. Ya lo arreglaremos.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "Ya + simple future = at some point, eventually, without saying when: Ya veremos (We'll see). Ya hablaremos. Ya me contarás cómo te fue. Often reassuring or a polite way to postpone.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "ya",
            "+ simple future"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It points to an **unspecified moment** later: _sometime, eventually, in due course_. English often leaves it untranslated."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Reassuring (**ya lo arreglaremos**) or noncommittal (**ya veremos**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In Mexico **ya** + **ir a** works too: **ya vamos a ver**, **ya me vas a contar**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **ya veremos** = maybe, ask me later."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "—¿Cuándo te vienes a vivir conmigo? —==Ya veremos==.",
              "en": "—When are you moving in with me? —We'll see."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Ya hablaremos== de eso.",
              "en": "We'll talk about that another time."
            },
